		"description": "<p>Also at 2nd level, your practice at readying your weapon quickly pays off. When you roll initiative, you may ready, and if needed load, a firearm. If you have two loaded firearms, you can instead ready them both when you roll initiative.</p><p>In addition, if you draw a loaded firearm while a hostile creature is surprised, you may make a single firearm attack against them as you roll initiative.</p>",
